---
name: signals-drawing
description: Chemical structures: fetch from Signals, compute with RDKit, show in Streamlit
invokable: true
---
- Notebook drawings: SignalsClient.list_chemical_drawings() / export_entity(eid, "smiles"|"svg"|"mol"); registered materials: get_chemical_drawing(asset_id, fmt) (GET /materials/{id}/drawing).
- Structure search: SignalsClient.chemistry_search(smiles, exact=False) ($chemsearch; substructure by default).
- Reaction tables: get_stoichiometry(eid).
- RDKit: Chem.MolFromSmiles (handle None), descriptors as in backend/context.py structure_context(). In Streamlit show SVG with st.image(svg.encode()).

